# PingOne Privilege MCPGW — OIDC configuration
# Copy to pingone.env and fill in real values.
# Mounted into the container at /var/lib/procyon/config/pingone.env.
# The mcpgw binary (-mcpconfpath flag) reads this file directly.
#
# This is the FRONT-END config: the gateway authenticates clients (browser users)
# against PingOne. Do not confuse it with the BACKEND hop (gateway → our mcp-server),
# which is configured in the Privilege console (MCP Application, Auth Mode = Static
# Token empty) and is intentionally unauthenticated because mcp-server runs
# MCP_AUTH_DISABLED=true.
#
# CRITICAL — SECRET TRANSCRIPTION:
# Copy OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET from demo_api_server/.env (PRIVILEGE_SSO_CLIENT_SECRET)
# character-for-character. The characters l (lowercase L) and I (uppercase I) are
# visually identical in most fonts; a single wrong character causes PingOne to reject
# the token exchange with "invalid_client".
#
# After editing: run k8s/create-secrets.sh, restart mcpgw, then restart demo-api-server
# (mcpgw loses in-memory DCR client state on restart; the BFF must be restarted too).

# Public URL of this MCPGW — the nginx/ingress front door, NOT the proxy's -listen port.
# This is what the 401 WWW-Authenticate challenge advertises to clients, so it must be
# browser-reachable. Redirect URI to register in PingOne: ${SERVER_URL}/callback
#
# Local Docker Compose:
SERVER_URL=https://mcpgw.local.ping-devops.com
# SE cluster (path-based ingress, /mcpgw prefix stripped before pod sees it):
# SERVER_URL=https://ai-demo.ping-devops.com/mcpgw

# PingOne application credentials.
# SE cluster env: 01d89b06 (AI-Demo, also holds Privilege access as of 2026-08-12)
# Known app: a6219652 (PingOne Privilege)
# Copy OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET from demo_api_server/.env PRIVILEGE_SSO_CLIENT_SECRET exactly.
OIDC_CLIENT_ID=<client-id>
OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET=<client-secret>

# PingOne authorization server endpoints — change <env-id> to match OIDC_CLIENT_ID's env.
OIDC_AUTH_URL=https://auth.pingone.com/<env-id>/as/authorize
OIDC_TOKEN_URL=https://auth.pingone.com/<env-id>/as/token
OIDC_USER_URL=https://auth.pingone.com/<env-id>/as/userinfo

OIDC_SCOPES=openid profile email
